# kr-port — Kamen Rider: Battride War Genesis PC port
# NEVER commit game data or anything derived from it. Each player uses their own dump.

# ---- Proprietary: the game and its files -----------------------------------------
# merged base+patch view (links into the user's dump: eboot.bin, nativeORBIS, sce_sys, sce_module)
/game/
# decrypted / relocated game executables
*.elf
*.self
*.sprx
*.prx
eboot.bin
# game data formats, in case any get copied around
*.fpk
*.at9
*.atp
*.pkg
*.sfo
sce_discmap*.plt
# copies of game files used for local tests (sysConf.boot original and 60 FPS)
/patches/sysconf/

# ---- Derived from the game's binary --------------------------------------------------
# Ghidra project (the disassembled/decompiled game); the scripts are ours and stay
/ghidra/*
!/ghidra/make_project.sh
!/ghidra/scripts/
# import/PLT tables extracted from the eboot (regenerate with tools/*.py from your own dump)
/imports_v*.json
/plt_v*.json
# scratch disassembly dumps
*.asm
text.bin

# ---- Build outputs, runs and captures --------------------------------------------------
# linked boot images contain the game's code; also logs, frame/audio dumps, benchmarks
/out/
/port/out/
/port/pgo/
*.raw
*.f32
*.frames

# ---- User data (saves, caches, logs) ------------------------------------------------
/user/
/port/user/

# ---- Screenshots and audio of the game (copyrighted art/sound; local only) ---------
/docs/relatorios/img/*
!/docs/relatorios/img/*tempo-de-quadro.png
/docs/relatorios/audio/

# ---- Third-party reference repositories (clone them yourself; see docs) ------------
/refs/

# ---- Editors / OS / Python -----------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
